OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment committed to a hate
OL,4,Acrime law
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's Justice & Home Affairs
OL,7,FMinister Helen Miles says she is
OL,8,F"committed to bringing forward hate
OL,9,Fcrime legislation" during this
OL,10,Fpolitical term.
OL,12,FResponding to a written question, she
OL,13,Fsaid she intended to have a draft ready
OL,14,Ffor a vote in the Assembly by the end
OL,15,Fof 2027.
OL,17,FMiles said she would "consult with the
OL,18,Fpublic, victims, community
OL,19,Forganisations, and criminal justice
OL,20,Fagencies" during the process.
